      <name>Skinny Bob&#x27;s Billiards</name>
      <styleUrl>#serious</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Status:</b> Serious room / anchor<br/><b>Address:</b> 300 Hesters Crossing Rd, Round Rock, TX 78681<br/><br/>18 nine-foot Diamond Pro-Am tables; two ten-foot Gabriel carom tables. Primary northern anchor; BCA/CSI Wednesday advertised, exact current division and table assignment unverified. Weekly nine-ball advertised Mon/Tue/Fri/Sat/Sun; Texas Open host.<br/><br/><a href="https://skinnybobs.com/pool/">Primary source / lead</a><br/>Reviewed 2026-10-24. Reverify time-sensitive schedules before travel.<br/><b>Coordinates:</b> US Census Geocoder Public_AR_Current, street-address match, 2026-10-24. Approximate interpolated street-address location; not a verified building entrance.]]></description>
